Z||000000||Formula||03-07-2000||08:25 PM||||Last week I was dissapointed in my formula because I lost to a civic.....<P>but this weeek........ BYE BYE TALON<P>I beat a 1998 Bright Red Eagle TALON ES<BR>It has a 5 speed, and a 16v dohc I4 with 20k miles. I'm also friends with the guy so I have supreme bragging rights in school.<P>We pulled up side by side at a stop light and had our nods.  The light turned green and I pulled extremly hard off the line to 40 mph, I had at least a car length on him.  Around 50 mph he started gaining slowly on me but he MISSED 3RD GEAR.  After I heard his miss I flashed the brake lights and called it quits.  <P>I followed him to his house, asked him what happened, he said he was trying to speed shift to catch back up to me but he missed 3rd.  I told him the honest truth that he was about ready to pass me but it would be really close in the 1/4 mile.  <P>I'll tell you one thing is for sure....<P>I LOVE TORQUE!!!!!!!!!!!<P>||||reg||1
