Z||000011||Shaun41178||03-10-2000||12:11 AM||||Formula:  It took me roughly 5 hours to install my kit.  It should take about the same for you.  I am running a 70 shot on my car and that has been for almost 2 years now and my engine still runs strong as hell.  I did a compression check about a month ago and had 150 on all cylinders even after all that nitrous.  <P>Do a compression check on your engine and see what it reads.  They all dont' have to be around 150, but just so that all cylinders read the same amount or close to it.<P>You might want to start out with a 50 shot and then go a bit higher.  Your engine will not blow up if the kit is installed properly.  Make sure the injectors are clean too.  you don't need bigger ones but make sure the ones you have flow well and have a good spray pattern.  An additive to the gas will work for that.<P>Smokey why don't you be more of a troll.  There are at least 4 people on this board that have nitrous on their engines and so far all still good.  No blowups.<P>As far as "fake horsepower" you can have that opinion but horsepower is still horsepower in my opinion and if I happen to pull up next to you someday and give you a rev and then blow your doors off in whatever car you drive, just remember that you just got whipped by "fake horsepower"  Man that must suck to get beat by fake horsepower huh?<P>Cheating? no its just another form of forced induction.<P>Let me know what racecar you drive since by your attitude you have real hp and can take me anyday of the week and twice on sunday.  I will tell you what, if you have anywhere near a stock V6 Fiero you will get yoiur @ss whooped and anything along the lines of a stock or lightly modded stang or 3rd gen or 4th gen F-bod I will take you too.  Unless you have a car that runs under 14's, which you might have you won't beat me.   But that is ok cause your car must have real hp and the "real thing" and must be a "real racecar" instead of a wanna-be and faker.<P>Man I love Fake horsepower!!! ||||reg||1
Z||000012||Phaeton||03-10-2000||12:55 AM||||Does this mean everything is just fake funny as I suck out the propellant in the whipped cream can?<P>One hp = 750 watts<BR>One fake hp = 750 whats<P>But officer those are fake mph, I'm on nitrous.<P>My cat is nitrous free and takes offense.<P>Well son, tell the judge this is a fake ticket.<P>Whoa, no wonder the engine likes this? hehehehe, back in a min, gotta go give the gas tank a shot of this stuff.||||reg||12
