Z||000031||BAM-BAM||03-14-2000||12:17 AM||||  Yo, Smokey, Greg, let it be. You are not going to convince anyone who wants to run NOS not to run it. Everyone has their game, let them play theirs and you play yours. I would be more than happy to play in your lane. I too believe that getting the most out of your engine shouldn't include the possibility of scattering it all over hell. But that's me. Personaly I don't race, never really interested me. When I pull up to a light and some little Chico in his 98 Honda or Nissan or Toyota Gives me the "REV", I'll rev back then let HIM get the ticket, or kill the kid in the crosswalk. One thing for sure, my name won't be on that ticket. So, in closing, CHILL, let the boys play. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>  Carefull Everyone <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>  BAM-BAM <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
